<p2><hon><sg>:>வ{II}>ங்>கள{Pul}             # 'iinkal'    singular       (honorific)
<p2><pl>:>வ{I}ய>ள{Pul}                      # 'iyal'      plural
<p2><pl>:>வ{II}>ங்>கள{Pul}                  # 'iinkal'    plural         (var)                      Dir/LR
<p2><pl>:>வ{II}>ர்>கள{Pul}                   # 'iirkal'    plural         (var)                      Dir/LR
# p3
## human
<p3><h><m><sg>:>வ{AAv}>ன{Pul}               # 'aan'       singular       (masc)
<p3><h><m><hon><sg>:>வ{AAv}>ர{Pul}           # 'aar'       singular       (masc honorific)
<p3><h><m><pl>:>வ{AAv}>ங்>கள{Pul}           # 'aankal'    plural         (masc)
<p3><h><m><pl>:>வ{AAv}>ர்>கள{Pul}           # 'aarkal'     plural         (masc var)                 Dir/LR
<p3><h><f><sg>:>வ{AAv}>ள{Pul}               # 'aal'       singular       (fem)
<p3><h><f><hon><sg>:>வ{AAv}                  # 'aa'        singular       (fem honorific)
<p3><h><f><pl>:>வ{AAv}ளவ{AI}               # 'aalavay'   plural         (fem)
<p3><h><f><pl>:>வ{AAv}>ளு>கள{Pul}          # 'aalukal'   plural         (fem var)                  Dir/LR  
<p3><h><epl><hon>:>வ{I}னம{Pul}             # 'inam'      epicene plural (honorific)
