###############################################################################
################################     PRONOUNS     ################################
LEXICON PronounStems
# human
நான்<prn><p1><h>:நா{NP}{Pul}[GPro,NObl]             # 'naan'            I
என்<prn><p1><h>:{El}{NP}{Pul}[GPro,Obl]              # 'en'              I          oblique stem for 'naan'
நீ<prn><p2><h>:ந{II}{AN}[PPro,PH,IH,NObl]             # 'nii'            you
உன்<prn><p2><h>:{Ul}{NP}{Pul}[GPro,PH,IH,Obl]        # 'un'             you        oblique stem for 'nee'
வன்<prn><p3><m><h>:வ>{NR}{Pul}[LOC,GPro,MH]         # '-van'            -he
வள்<prn><p3><f><h>:வ>{PL}{Pul}[LOC,FPro,FH]         # '-val'           -she
வ<prn><p3><mf><h>:வ[LOC,EHIrr]                      # '-va'            -they-
# non-human
து<prn><p3><nt><nh>:த{U}[LOC,GPro]                   # '-thu'            -it

LEXICON InterProStem
என்ன<prn><ind><itg>:எ>ன்ன[NN]                     # 'enna'            what
ஆர்<prn><ind><h><itg>:ஆ>ர{Pul}[AA]                 # 'aar'              who
யார்<prn><ind><h><itg>:யா>ர{Pul}[AA]                # 'yaar'            who

LEXICON IndefProStem
எல்லா<prn><ind>:எல்ல{AAv}                          # 'ella'            every-

################################     NOUNS & NP     ################################
LEXICON Nouns
#####
# UYARTHINAI Grouped into FEMALE, MALE and UNISEX
# FEMALE and MALE further grouped into Classes I - IV
# 0th Class contains words with no gendered equivalent or irregulars
#####
## For MALE Professions, '-kaaran' is changed to '-kaari' in FEMALE
## In other instances, FEMALE equivalents exist as '-i' for MALE '-an' most commonly, among other forms as listed below
# MALE I: -'an', II: -'aan', III: -'van', IV: communal words
# FEMALE I(a): -'al', (b): -'i', (c): -'aththi', (d): -'cci',
## II(a): -'aal', II(b): -'aaththi', II(c): -'aatti'
## III: -'ththi', IV: communal words  
##################### ANIMATE
# 'kaaran' here denoting professions is built-in (female eq. 'kaari')
# loanwords with language of origin placed on top of each class
# irregulars placed after
# Class 1
## UNGENDERED (AHTHINAI Animate)
மாடு<n><aa>:மா{T}{U}[AA,Pl1]                                       # 'maatu'           cow
ஆடு<n><aa>:ஆ{T}{U}[AA,Pl1]                                        # 'aatu'            goat
மீன்<n><aa>:மீ{N}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                                       # 'miin'            fish
நாய்<n><aa>:நா{Y}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                                     # 'naai'            dog
## UNISEX
குடும்பம்<n><mf><aa>:குடும்ப{M}{Pul}[AA,MGEN,Pl1]                   # 'kutumpam'       family                                loanword (Sanskrit)
ஆள்<n><mf><aa>:ஆள{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                                   # 'aal'            person
ஒராள்<n><mf><aa>:ஒர>{AA}ள{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                            # 'oraal'          one person
பேர்<n><mf><aa>:பே{R}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                                  # 'peer'           person
பிள்ள<n><mf><aa>:பிள்ள[AA,Pl1]                                     # 'pilla'           child                                Dir/LR
புள்ள<n><mf><aa>:புள்ள[AA,Pl1]                                      # 'pulla'          child                                 Dir/LR
## FEMALE
### 0
பெண்<n><f><aa>:பெ{NN}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                                # 'pen'             female
### I(a)
பெடியள்<n><f><aa>:பெடிய{PLR}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                         # 'petiyal'         girl
### I(b)
பெடி<n><f><aa>:பெட{I}[AA,Pl1]                                      # 'peti'            girl
## MALE
### 0
அலுகோசு<n><m><aa>:அலுகோச{U}[AA,Pl1]                            # 'alukoocu'       executioner                         loanword (Portuguese)
மஹத்தயா<n><m><aa>:மஹத்தய{AA}[AA,Pl1]                          # 'mahaththayaa'   mister                              loanword (Sinhala)
சேவகன்<n><m><aa>:சேவக{N}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                            # 'ceevakan'       servant                             loanword (Sinhala)
வேலையாள்<n><m><aa>:வேலை>யா{LK}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                  # 'veelayyaal'     male worker
### I
வேலைக்காரன்<n><m><aa>:வேலை>க்கார{N}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]             # 'veelaykkaaran'   male servant
பெடியன்<n><m><aa>:பெடிய{N}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                          # 'petiyan'         boy
### II
ஆண்<n><m><aa>:ஆ{NP}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                                 # 'aan'             male
மனிதன்<n><m><aa>:மனித{NK}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                           # 'manithan'        man
மனிசன்<n><m><aa>:மனிச{NK}{Pul}[AA,Pl1]                           # 'manican'         man                                Dir/LR
### IV
கவி<n><m><aa>:கவ{I}[AA,Pl1]                                        # 'kavi'            poet                               loanword (Sanskrit)
காரைக்கவி<n><m><aa>:காரைக்கவ{I}[AA,Pl1]                        # 'kaaraykkavi'     poet from Karainagar               loanword (Sanskrit)
பண்டாரம்<n><m><aa>:பண்டார{M}{Pul}[AA,MGEN,Pl1]                  # 'pantaaram'       male from pantaaram comm.
பண்டாரி<n><m><aa>:பண்டார{I}[AA,Pl1]                             # 'pantaari'        male from pantaaram comm.          Dir/LR

# Class 2
## FEMALE
### II(a)
