## Quality Nouns <nq> (can take Adjectivizer [NQ])
குணம்<nq><nn>:குண>{M}{Pul}[NN,MGEN,Pl1,NQ]                     # 'kunam'           quality           loanword (Sanskrit)
யோக்கியம்<nq><nn>:யோக்கிய>{M}{Pul}[NN,MGEN,Pl1,NQ]           # 'yookkiyam'       integrity         loanword (Sanskrit)
உயரம்<nq><nn>:உயர>{M}{Pul}[NN,MGEN,Pl1,NQ]                    # 'uyaram'           height
இரக்கம்<nq><nn>:இரக்க>{M}{Pul}[NN,MGEN,Pl1,NQ]                  # 'irakkam'         compassion
நீளம்<nq><nn>:நீள>{M}{Pul}[NN,MGEN,Pl1,NQ]                        # 'neelam'          length
அகலம்<nq><nn>:அகல{M}{Pul}[NN,MGEN,Pl1,NQ]                     # 'akalam'          width
பெறுமதி<nq><nn>:பெறுமத{I}[NN,Pl1,NQ]                          # 'perumathi'       value
எடை<nq><nn>:எட{AI}[NN,Pl1,NQ]                                   # 'etay'            weight

## Irregular UNISEX Inanimate (babies and infants)
### can take Animate case markings
குழந்தை<n><mf><nn>:குழந்த{AI}[NNIrr,Pl1]                        # 'kuzhanthay'      infant

