கதை<n><nn>:கத{AI}[NN,Pl3]                                      # 'kathay'          story
சிறுகதை<n><nn>:சிறுகத{AI}[NN,Pl3]                              # 'cirukathay'      short story
பனை<n><nn>:பன{AI}[NN,Pl3]                                     # 'panay'           palmyra
