நீந்து<v><iv>:நீந்த{U}[Class3,W]                        # 'neentu'       swim                    Paired
ஆகு<v><iv>:ஆக{U}[Class3,W]                         # 'aaku'        happen                   Paired
எண்ணு<v><tv>:எண்ண{U}[Class3,W]                  # 'ennu'        count                    Paired
