# Class 5e
வில்<v><iv>:வ{I}{LR}{Pul}[Class5e]                   # 'vil'          sell                     Paired

# Class 6
கதை<v><iv>:கத{AI}[Class6,S]                        # 'kathay'      speak                   loanword (Sanskrit)
யோசி<v><iv>:யோச{I}[Class6,S]                     # 'yooci'       think                   loanword (Sanskrit)       Paired
கிடை<v><iv>:கிட{AI}[Class6,S]                       # 'kitay'       be available            Paired
வலி<v><iv>:வல{I}[Class6,S]                          # 'vali'        ache
வெளி<v><iv>:வெள{I}[Class6,S]                      # 'veli'        clear
சிரி<v><iv>:சிர{I}[Class6,S]                           # 'siri'        laugh
தெரி<v><iv>:தெர{I}[Class6,S]                        # 'theri'       perverse
அடு<v><iv>:அட{U}[Class6,S]                          # 'atu'         approach
வலு<v><iv>:வல{U}[Class6,S]                         # 'valu'        strong
தேர்<v><iv>:த{EE}ர{Pul}[Class6,S]                    # 'theer'       mingle

# Class 7
மற<v><iv>:மற{A}[Class7,S]                          # 'mara'        forget                   Paired
இரு<vbser><iv>:இர{U}[Class7,S]                      # 'iru'         be
கிட<v><iv>:கிட{A}[Class7,S]                          # 'kita'        lie down
